flowchart TD
  A[Issue and acceptance criteria] --> B[Threat and privacy review]
  B --> C[Implementation]
  C --> D[Unit and integration tests]
  D --> E[Authorization isolation tests]
  E --> F[Build and lint]
  F --> G{All required checks pass?}
  G -- No --> C
  G -- Yes --> H[Documentation and migration review]
  H --> I[Backup and rollback plan]
  I --> J[Release]
  J --> K[Monitor and record feedback]
